ai/PLAN_M11_2.md:216:| memory context GET lazy backfill | 1 | the read path invokes the context-write action (`payload.lazy: true`) — the admissions read-path precedent; state-changing GETs are enumerated in the P0 inventory so method-based sweeps cannot miss them |
