    80	
    81	| Task | Command |
    82	|------|--------|
    83	| Install dependencies | `npm install` |
    84	| Run dev server | `npm run dev` -> http://localhost:3000 |
    85	| Production build | `npm run build` |
    86	| Start production server | `npm start` |
    87	| Lint | `npm run lint` |
    88	| Run unit tests | `npm test` |
    89	| Run tests (watch) | `npm test -- --watch` |
    90	| Run tests (coverage) | `npm test -- --coverage` |
