    87	    // Leased FIRST. The barrier must be able to see an invocation that is still mid-drain — one
    88	    // that has receipted nothing yet but still could, under whatever effect set this build carries.
    89	    // A signal written only on completion cannot show that, and a cutover would proceed while an
    90	    // old invocation was still running.
